<section id="A3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.3 </span>Off-policy BoN</h3>

<div id="A3.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide our implementation of off-policy BoN objective in Listing <span class="ltx_ref ltx_missing_label ltx_ref_self"></span>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="LST3" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:393.5pt;">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
